    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "科技與人文、生態環境等觀念進行知識的傳授和告訴學生嶄新的觀念。",
      "describe_en": "Responsible engineering professionalism as a guiding ideal in engineering ethics."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "希望每一位學生在畢業後成為知分寸、有立場、能明辨是非和能做正確抉擇、術德兼備的專業人員。",
      "describe_en": "We attempt to help students understand professional responsibility intellectually. Exposure to case studies helps them feel it"
    }
